                ['Is a master\'s degree compulsory?', '<p>No. Three routes exist: a master\'s in business and management; a master\'s in any subject with more than five years of managerial experience; or a bachelor\'s in any subject with more than eight years. The last of these is Recognition of Prior Experience, and anyone admitted that way is eligible for the DBA only.</p>', 2],
